  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_SHARED_SCENE",
    "dynamic_line": "玛雅把窗边的椅子让出一半，梁知遥却没有坐。她先蹲下来，检查固定带有没有松动，又看了看玛雅落地时下意识避开的角度。\n\n“检查完了吗，梁知遥同学？”",
    "speaker_effect": {
      "effect": [
        {
          "run_eocs": [
            "EOC_TRAVEL_MAYA_SCAN_LIANG_NEARBY"
          ]
        },
        {
          "run_eocs": [
            "EOC_TRAVEL_MAYA_SHARED_SCENE_SYNC"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "responses": [
      {
        "text": "[看向梁知遥，等她回答。]",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_LIANG_SHARED_SCENE_CHECK"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_PLAN",
    "dynamic_line": "梁知遥看向桌上摊开的地图。\n\n“她留在这里。农场有干净的水、药和认识她的人。我继续跟你走，找更远的通信线索，也把外面的变化带回来。”",
    "responses": [
      {
        "text": "[听听玛雅怎么说。]",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_PLAN_MAYA"
      }
    ],
    "speaker_npc": "TRAVEL_LIANG_ZHIYAO",
    "speaker_npc_range": 30
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_ARROW_WORK",
    "dynamic_line": "梁知遥拿起一支还没装箭头的木箭杆，先看尾栝，再用指腹摸过羽片槽。\n\n“她以前就这样。别人练完去吃饭，她留下来把器材表补齐，把弦距和损坏的箭一支支记下来。”",
    "responses": [
      {
        "text": "[把箭杆还给玛雅。]",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_ARROW_WORK_MAYA"
      }
    ],
    "speaker_npc": "TRAVEL_LIANG_ZHIYAO",
    "speaker_npc_range": 30
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_TRAVEL_LIANG_SHARED_SCENE_CHECK",
    "speaker_npc": "TRAVEL_LIANG_ZHIYAO",
    "speaker_npc_range": 30,
    "dynamic_line": "“没有。你刚才从椅子上站起来时，把重量全偏到左腿了。”",
    "responses": [
      {
        "text": "[听玛雅接着说。]",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_SHARED_SCENE_PUNCHLINE"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_SHARED_SCENE_PUNCHLINE",
    "dynamic_line": "玛雅叹了口气。\n\n“这就是和一个会做记录的人住过太久的后果。”",
    "responses": [
      {
        "text": "所以，你们接下来怎么打算？",
