        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_LIANG_ARROW_WORK"
      },
      {
        "text": "[返回梁知遥与玛雅] 先让你们歇一会儿。",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_MENU_LIANG"
      },
